<title>USA: James River sets special meeting date.</title>
<headline>James River sets special meeting date.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>James River Corp said it has set August 12 as the date for the special meeting of shareholders to vote on a merger agreement with Fort Howard Corp </p>
<p>Shareholders of record at the close of business on June 30 are eligible to vote.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
